<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-LEICESTER SIGN FIJIANS SEREVI AND VUNIBAKA.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-LEICESTER SIGN FIJIANS SEREVI AND VUNIBAKA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leicester have signed Fijian international backs Waisale Serevi and Marika Vunibaka for the next northern season.</p>
<p>Serevi led Fiji to victory in the Hong Kong sevens this year.</p>
</text>
